{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Integrate-MISO","text":"Integrate MISO","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager","text":"Use Swift Package Manager","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Swift Package","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"package dependency","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" to your ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.0.0-rc3","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need","text":"Import the libraries you need","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" products."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}],"style":"tip","name":"Tip"},{"code":["import MISOThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or MISOThemeableView","import MISOModules \/\/ To use modules","import MISOComponents \/\/ To use components","import MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat \/\/ To use the BlueCoat theme","import MISOTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import MISOTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import MISOTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import MISOFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library","text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and useless constants.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Note"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"type":"text","text":" product which suits your needs:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"MISOSwiftUI","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above and the BlueCoat theme"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"MISOSwiftUIBlueCoat","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All libraries listed above but with only BlueCoat theme","type":"text"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Chose your theme","anchor":"Chose-your-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"MISO","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" framework provides today one theme:"}]},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Theme","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"BlueCoat","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts without any brand-flavoured styles"}]}]]]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Apply a theme","anchor":"Apply-a-theme"},{"columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You will need to use for your application root view the ","type":"text"},{"code":"MISOThemeableView","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          MISOThemeableView(theme: BlueCoatTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"type":"row","numberOfColumns":2},{"numberOfColumns":2,"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"]}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"tip","type":"aside","name":"Tip"},{"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use Xcode ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Apply BlueCoat theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .blueCoatPreview()","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Welcome to MISO"}],"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with MISO","roleHeading":"Article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}]},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Modules"],"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"abstract":[{"text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps.","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Modules":{"kind":"article","title":"Modules","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Modules","type":"topic","images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"module"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" can be seen as a set of features and components to fill a need.","type":"text"}],"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/modules"},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"🐙🍜 MISO is a library of SwiftUI components (forked from "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios"},{"type":"text","text":"), themes and tools for iOS app development."}],"title":"Welcome to MISO","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract","kind":"symbol","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}]},"ic_logo_miso.png":{"alt":null,"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOThemesContract\/ic_logo_miso.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image"},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Themes":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}],"title":"Themes","abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Themes","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" are applications of specific values for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"components tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"semantic tokens"}]},{"type":"text","text":" using in the end "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"raw tokens","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":".(thus final usable low level values)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme"}]},{"type":"text","text":" contains any relevant tokens which can be used for components rendering."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme"}]},{"type":"text","text":" can use its own assets like fonts and icons."}],"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/themes"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","title":"ouds-ios","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}]},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Tokens":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/tokens","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Design tokens represent the small, repeated design decisions that make up a design system’s visual style. Tokens wrap hard-coded static values, such as hexadecimal codes for color, with self-explanatory names. They are used to define the look and feel and the style of everything. They are exposed through the themes and can be used as they are.","type":"text"}],"title":"Tokens","role":"article","type":"topic"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/miso-ios/wiki/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds":{"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","title":"refer to the wiki","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"refer to the wiki"}]},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Components":{"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}],"title":"Components","abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Components","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" objects you can add in the views of your apps, like buttons, links, cards etc."}],"role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","kind":"article","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/components"}}}